// fixture for comlint_kw_wildcard.comt -- comlint's INPUT, never run
// directly (never registered in run_all.comt). Exercises comlint's
// unrecognized-keyword check against the documented wildcard idiom
// "[:<name> [val]]": kw_wild calls attrlist() under comdraw, where
// ComUnidraw's GrAttrListFunc overrides the base ComTerp docstring
// with its own compview-vs-bare-keyword-args prose -- this must stay
// flag-free no matter what keyword names are passed, since the
// docstring's own "[:<name> [val]]" fragment is comlint's signal that
// the keyword set is open-ended. kw_fixed calls line(), whose
// docstring declares no keywords at all, with a keyword no version of
// line() has ever accepted -- the wildcard idiom must not suppress
// this unrelated command's real finding.
kw_wild=attrlist(:ok true :ports (1,2,3) :socks (4,5))
kw_fixed=line(0,0,10,10 :notakeyword 1)
